<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI slows to 0.9 pct monthly in November.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI slows to 0.9 pct monthly in November.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 0.9 percent in November, the slowest monthly rise of the year, after 2.8 percent in October, the State Statistics Committee said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  NOV 96    OCT 96    NOV 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change    +0.9	+2.8	+2.9</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     +26.9     +29.5    +200.5</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
